From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: AztecBot <tech@aztec-labs.com>
Date: Wed, 7 Oct 2026 21:48:35 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] chore: re-pin the standard contracts for the v3 address
 separator

HandshakeRegistry reaches get_public_keys, which asserts
account == AztecAddress::compute(public_keys, partial_address), so the address
domain separator is compiled into its bytecode. The pinned build therefore has
to be refreshed with the separator: left alone it derives v5 addresses inside a
v6 tree and rejects every account.

Re-pinning recompiles all four standard contracts, which also moves
MultiCallEntrypoint's artifact hash and private functions root - unrelated to
the separator, and a consequence of the pinned build being six weeks old. Its
canonical address moves with them.

diff --git a/noir-projects/aztec-nr/aztec/src/standard_addresses.nr b/noir-projects/aztec-nr/aztec/src/standard_addresses.nr
index 1b8553a00d13f89d8f8089940e958e1f2cae7b38..8fc4399ea3c60cbef7d2bf4ffeaf8e11471a94e8 100644
--- a/noir-projects/aztec-nr/aztec/src/standard_addresses.nr
+++ b/noir-projects/aztec-nr/aztec/src/standard_addresses.nr
@@ -6,7 +6,7 @@ pub global STANDARD_AUTH_REGISTRY_ADDRESS: AztecAddress = AztecAddress::from_fie
 );
 
 pub global STANDARD_MULTI_CALL_ENTRYPOINT_ADDRESS: AztecAddress = AztecAddress::from_field(
-    0x063b74f69435c76e490b3dedd9238552228b523f233235152b236981cdf025f4,
+    0x24bf89a314dd934544c36ca1a622992d48c3f572a01d7d31bbccf83e94f33e18,
 );
 
 pub global STANDARD_PUBLIC_CHECKS_ADDRESS: AztecAddress = AztecAddress::from_field(
@@ -14,5 +14,5 @@ pub global STANDARD_PUBLIC_CHECKS_ADDRESS: AztecAddress = AztecAddress::from_fie
 );
 
 pub global STANDARD_HANDSHAKE_REGISTRY_ADDRESS: AztecAddress = AztecAddress::from_field(
-    0x13833f89e250646a1ca08fef8b00bc96eb20df07bc0917bcdba3adedbdf99611,
+    0x1348f15cc3a52173965ebf7321f752daa4d2106872e2618463c225bbf6cfbaa1,
 );
diff --git a/noir-projects/noir-contracts/pinned-standard-contracts.tar.gz b/noir-projects/noir-contracts/pinned-standard-contracts.tar.gz
index 379a21e97ebc36da67dd70ba867c7da1939041de..ea6c8d2d545d3736012ea1972045f4c0b5480402 100644
